     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Pic Greg Macvean 31/07/2020 Scottish Conservatives&#xD;Douglas Ross today announced his leadership bid for the Scottish Conservatives.  His campaign is being supported by former leader Ruth Davidson.  Both are pictured at the Apex Hotel in the Grassmarket of Edinburgh.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
